<title>USA: Recycling names CEO T. Wiens president, COO.</title>
<headline>Recycling names CEO T. Wiens president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colorado 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Recycling Industries Inc said Monday it named Thomas Wiens, who is currently chairman and chief executive, to the added jobs of president and chief operating officer on a temporary basis.</p>
<p>The company said it is &quot;negotiating with experienced industry executives&quot; to replace Michael Price, who formerly held those positions.</p>
<p>Price continues as a director of the company.</p>
</text>
